  "description": "The latest generation of the UPPER adds more speed and even crisper handling to its already legendary comfort and toughness.\nNow more than ever, it is THE gravel frame that can hang with the roadies on pavement and take off when the roads turn rough.This bike is built for speed, optimized for 35-46mm tires (at 50mm, there is a significant drop in speed so this width should be avoided. Then it's better to jump to 55-61mm on the OPEN WIDE 2.0)\nThe ultralight OPEN BAR cockpit offers 15mm of micro-stem length adjustment in 5mm steps, while the size-specific frame design ensure the best experience regardless of rider height. The UPPER 2.0 comes with our completely new U-Turn Aero fork, our fastest fork. For a fork with cargo options, check out the UP 2.0 Adventure. The CHASSIS includes frame, fork, headset, seatpost and integrated handlebar/stem. During check-out you can specify the handlebar size you want in the \"Additional Information\" field. If you're not sure, simply write \"need help with frame/handlebar sizing\" and we'll contact you.",
